  "title": "Jazzed Up Couscous",
  "description": "Couscous and tomatoes are combined with garlic, onions, and jack cheese. Super easy, super quick, and inexpensive, but it tastes like a million bucks!",
  "authors": [
    "Nicole"
  ],
